                  :attrib "Yes Man"}
                 {:text "Obsidian built New Vegas in about 18 months, reusing Fallout 3's engine to make the deadline."
                  :attrib "development trivia"}
                 {:text "New Vegas needed an 85 on Metacritic for Obsidian's contractual bonus. It scored 84."
                  :attrib "development trivia"}
                 {:text "Every player turns on Hardcore Mode, dies of dehydration outside Goodsprings, and quietly turns it back off."
                  :attrib "every player, eventually"}
                 {:text "You'll spend hours deciding who deserves the Strip — NCR, Legion, House, or yourself — and still aren't sure."
                  :attrib "every player, eventually"}
                 {:text "You pick Wild Wasteland for the jokes, then forget you did until a UFO crashes into the road ahead."
                  :attrib "every player, eventually"}]
