         :quotes [{:text "Golly, you're the best! I'm going to follow you and watch you and worship the ground you walk on! Let's go!"
                  :attrib "Adoring Fan"}
                 {:text "Find him, and close shut the jaws of Oblivion."
                  :attrib "Uriel Septim VII"}
                 {:text "Stop right there, criminal scum!"
                  :attrib "Imperial City Watch guard"}
                 {:text "17 voice actors voiced 1,497 NPCs — a ratio you can hear in every tavern conversation."
                  :attrib "development trivia"}
                 {:text "Todd Howard voiced one NPC himself: the Daedric Prince Clavicus Vile."
                  :attrib "development trivia"}
                 {:text "Every player spends the whole game trying not to look at NPC faces too closely."
                  :attrib "every player, eventually"}
                 {:text "You get arrested for trespassing in your own house because a guard saw you climb through the window."
                  :attrib "every player, eventually"}
                 {:text "By the twentieth Oblivion Gate, you're closing them out of obligation, not heroism."
                  :attrib "every player, eventually"}]
